{
  "id": "938",
  "title": "One Million Cats",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-05-13",
  "synopsis": "An old man and an old lady are getting a cat. But what will happen?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/938/5965a64a4d2781e3c9cb513673242ef881e50104.mp3?1588496669",
  "series": {
    "title": "One Million Cats",
    "chapter": 2,
    "totalChapters": 9
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "    老爷爷看到这只猫很漂亮，买！看到那只猫很漂亮，买！\n    老爷爷买了这只猫，又买了那只猫。老爷爷买啊买啊，商店里的猫他都买了。\n    商店里有一百万只猫，老爷爷都买了。\n    老爷爷很高兴，他要回家了。\n    一百万只猫在老爷爷后面，和老爷爷一起回家了。",
    "traditional": "    老爺爺看到這隻貓很漂亮，買！看到那隻貓很漂亮，買！\n    老爺爺買了這隻貓，又買了那隻貓。老爺爺買啊買啊，商店裡的貓他都買了。\n    商店裡有一百萬隻貓，老爺爺都買了。\n    老爺爺很高興，他要回家了。\n    一百萬隻貓在老爺爺後面，和老爺爺一起回家了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "老爷爷看到这只猫很漂亮，买！看到那只猫很漂亮，买！",
      "traditional": "老爺爺看到這隻貓很漂亮，買！看到那隻貓很漂亮，買！",
      "pinyin": "lǎo yé ye kàn dào zhè zhī māo hěn piào liang mǎi kàn dào nà zhī māo hěn piào liang mǎi",
      "english": "The old man saw this very beautiful cat, and bought it! The old man saw that very beautiful cat, and bought it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "老爷爷买了这只猫，又买了那只猫。",
      "traditional": "老爺爺買了這隻貓，又買了那隻貓。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo yé ye mǎi le zhè zhī māo yòu mǎi le nà zhī māo",
      "english": "The old man bought this cat, and also bought that cat."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老爷爷买啊买啊，商店里的猫他都买了。",
      "traditional": "老爺爺買啊買啊，商店裡的貓他都買了。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo yé ye mǎi a mǎi a shāng diàn lǐ de māo tā dōu mǎi le",
      "english": "The old man bought and bought. He bought all the cats in the store."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "商店里有一百万只猫，老爷爷都买了。",
      "traditional": "商店裡有一百萬隻貓，老爺爺都買了。",
      "pinyin": "shāng diàn lǐ yǒu yì bǎi wàn zhī māo lǎo yé ye dōu mǎi le",
      "english": "There were one million cats in the store, and the old man bought all of them."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "老爷爷很高兴，他要回家了。",
      "traditional": "老爺爺很高興，他要回家了。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo yé ye hěn gāo xìng tā yào huí jiā le",
      "english": "The old man was very happy. He went back home."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "一百万只猫在老爷爷后面，和老爷爷一起回家了。",
      "traditional": "一百萬隻貓在老爺爺後面，和老爺爺一起回家了。",
      "pinyin": "yì bǎi wàn zhī māo zài lǎo yé ye hòu miàn hé lǎo yé ye yì qǐ huí jiā le",
      "english": "The one million cats were behind the old man, returning home together with the old man."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
